@NAME@ @VERSION@
================

OpenGL in a GTK program on RISC OS: an example from the riscos-gtk
devkit. A spinning triangle, drawn with a vertex buffer and GLSL
shaders by riscos-mesa (Mesa's software renderer, OpenGL 2.1). The frame
rate is shown underneath; untick Spin to stop it.

Click Select on its icon bar icon for the window.

It needs RISC OS 5, a 16 or 32 bpp screen mode, and SharedUnixLibrary
1.16 or later, ARMEABISupport and Iconv from PackMan.

Problems are written to its Log, <Wimp$ScrapDir>.@NAME@.Log.

